    "answerState": "Exploratory",
    "answerText": "You currently have **Lightspeed operational data covering 7 July–7 August 2026**. The main usable areas are sales, products, customers, payments, staff attribution and reconciliation.\n\n### Current data snapshot\n- **790 sales-event records**, representing **302 orders**\n- **$38,290.40 net sales ex GST** and **859 net units**\n- **349 POS payment records** through 6 August\n- **47 identified customers**, **34 products sold**, **6 workers** and **1 location** represented\n- **16 customer-order activity records**\n- Daily sales, merchandising, workforce/sales and reconciliation summaries are also populated\n\n### Product data quality\nMost sales are currently **uncategorised**: **$35,615.70** of net sales. Among named categories, *Wheels & Tyres* leads with **$1,013.55**.\n\n### Current gaps\n- Detailed inventory snapshots contain no records. The merchandising snapshot for 7 August reports zero populated stock units/value.\n- Xero finance-day and bank-transaction tables currently contain no records.\n- Detailed roster, worked-hours and labour-cost records are not populated.\n\nSo, at present I can analyse sales performance, products/categories, customers, payments, sales by worker/location and POS reconciliation. Finance, stock-on-hand and labour analysis will remain limited until those feeds populate.\n\nFigures cover Defined by the statement from Lightspeed, current to 2026-08-07.",
